  "description": "# SIP2.47: Add 1 Ark to LazyVault_HigherRisk_USDC Fleet on mainnet\n\n## Summary\nThis is a cross-chain governance proposal to add 1 new Ark to the existing LazyVault_HigherRisk_USDC Fleet on mainnet.\n\n## Motivation\nExpanding this fleet with additional an Ark will enhance the protocol's capabilities on mainnet.\n\n## Technical Details\n- Hub Chain: base (Production)\n- Target Chain: mainnet\n- Fleet Commander: 0xE9cDA459bED6dcfb8AC61CD8cE08E2D52370cB06\n- Number of Ark to add: 1\n\n## New Ark Address\n1. `0x1C354B455bEf33744397A561dC518A2a9F4f5bab`\n\n## Specifications\n### Actions\nThis proposal will execute the following actions on mainnet:\n1. Grant COMMANDER_ROLE to Fleet Commander for the Ark\n2. Add the Ark to the Fleet Commander\n\n### Cross-chain Mechanism\nThis proposal uses LayerZero to execute governance actions across chains.\n\n## References\nDiscourse: https://forum.summer.fi/t/sip2-47-onboard-ousd-to-the-higher-risk-usdc-mainnet-fleet/665/7\n",
